; t27_callable.n — v16 fn cells: code is a value.
; A bare label name is an implicit fn reference (tag 22); 'label is the
; call form (retires _call); every callback-taking op accepts a fn cell.
; Run: nk comp/tests/t27_callable.n

; 1. the call form
3 4 'add2 total!
total 7 eq check

; 2. bare references feeding for/while
5 dbl for
0 n!
3 less tick while
n 3 eq check

; 3. fn cell stored in a var, passed to array_map/filter
[1 2 3] cells!
cells sq array_map mapped!
mapped to_json "[1,4,9]" eq check
cells keep filter to_json "[3]" eq check

; 4. fn cells inside containers — a list of fns, fetched and applied
[sq keep] fns!
cells fns 0 get array_map to_json "[1,4,9]" eq check

; 5. try/spawn accept bare body references
diver try ok# _#
ok 0 eq check
worker spawn ch!
ch dequeue 42 eq check

; 6. type_of reports the fn tag (22)
sq f!
f type_of 22 eq check

; 7. frame-shared while continuations (fib-style iteration, bare refs)
0 a2! 1 b2! 10 i2!
cond2 more while
a2 55 eq check

; 8. method dispatch: 'recv.method is the call
[1 2 3] lst!
lst 'lst.length 3 eq check

; 9. a weave task body references its task-local helper label bare
weave
  wtot:
    [1 2 3] 0 wadd array_reduce
    ret
  wadd: acc2! v2!
    ret acc2 v2 add
run
w!  w 6 eq check

ret
add2: a! b!
  ret a b add
dbl: k!
  k 2 mul 0
  ret 0
less: ret n 3 lt
tick: n 1 add n!
  ret 0
sq: x!
  ret x x mul
keep: v!
  ret v 2 gt
diver: ret 1 0 div
worker: ret 42
more: a2 b2 add t2!  b2 a2!  t2 b2!  i2 1 sub i2!
  ret 0
cond2: ret i2 0 gt
